### 1. GET Semua Produk
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 2. POST Tambah Produk (Kopi Gayo, Stok: 50, Harga: 85000)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika",
  "description": "Biji kopi sangrai premium 250g",
  "price": 85000.0,
  "stock": 50,
  "category": "Minuman"
}

### ========================================================
### FITUR TRANSAKSI & SIKLUS ORDER (MARKETPLACE)
### ========================================================

### 3. CHECKOUT: Beli 5 Kopi Gayo (ID: 1, Qty: 5)
# Status awal: PENDING, Total: 425.000, Sisa Stok Kopi: 50 -> 45
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 5
}

### 4. Cek Sisa Stok Kopi (Harusnya tinggal 45)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 5. UPDATE STATUS: Pembeli Melakukan Pembayaran (PAID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PAID"
}

### 6. UPDATE STATUS: Penjual Mengirim Barang (SHIPPED)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SHIPPED"
}

### 7. UPDATE STATUS: Pembeli Konfirmasi Barang Diterima (DELIVERED)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DELIVERED"
}

### ========================================================
### UJI COBA PEMBATALAN ORDER (RESTOCK OTOMATIS)
### ========================================================

### 8. CHECKOUT BARU: Beli 10 Kopi Gayo (Sisa Stok: 45 -> 35)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 10
}

### 9. BATALKAN ORDER ID 2: Ubah status jadi CANCELLED
# Ekspektasi: Order dibatalkan, dan 10 kopi otomatis dikembalikan ke stok (35 -> 45)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CANCELLED"
}

### 10. Cek Stok Kopi Kembali Pulih Menjadi 45!
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 11. Cek Seluruh Riwayat Orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
